> +					       <&audma0 0x4f>, <&audma1 0x50>,
> +					       <&audma0 0x53>, <&audma1 0x54>;
> +					dma-names = "rx", "tx",
> +						    "rxu", "txu",
> +						    "rxu0", "txu0",
> +						    "rxu1", "txu1",
> +						    "rxu2", "txu2",
> +						    "rxu3", "txu3",
> +						    "rxu4", "txu4",
> +						    "rxu5", "txu5",
> +						    "rxu6", "txu6",
> +						    "rxu7", "txu7";

In theory, I think DT side patch should be posted/applied
if driver side patch was accepted.
And, Gen3 side DT doesn't need "rxu/txu" I think.
